  "body": "**Link to problem area**:\n\nhttps://spec.matrix.org/v1.13/client-server-api/#client-behaviour-23\n\n**Issue**\n\nThe current text states that servers should drop \"events sent by [an ignored user]\" from sync responses, but doesn't explain what should happen with `m.typing` and `m.receipt` events, which are more aggregating data sent by several users than they are \"events sent by the ignored user\".",
